            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 6.5</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">New</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>3D objects from text.</b> Describe an object in the 3D Scene Composer and get it as a 3D model, placed in your scene.</li>
<li><b>Poly Haven library.</b> Search free CC0 models under Add and place them at real-world size.</li>
<li><b>Meshy 7.1.</b> The quality tier for 3D models now keeps small details.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">Improved</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Leaner 3D Scene Composer.</b> Simpler panels, assets grouped in the settings panel and a slimmer object library.</li>
<li><b>Switch modes from the 3D Scene Composer.</b> Go to Studio, Agent or Nodes without closing it first.</li>
<li><b>Up to 150 objects per scene.</b></li>
</ul>
]]></description>
